          "kind": "text",
          "markdown": "## Fields\n\nA gadget is read through its fields; the free builtins document the rest:\n\n| builtin | reading |\n| --- | --- |\n| `len(g)` | the field count |\n\nAn example that is not run keeps its `norun` marker in the source only; the page shows a plain `go` fence:\n"
