      "doc": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "markdown": "## Overview\n\nThe page head: its own `##` sections, verbatim.\n\n- a list item\nwith an unindented continuation line\n- a second item\n\n| operator | reading |\n| --- | --- |\n| `w + x` | exactly `append(x)` |\n\n### A third-level heading\n"
        },
        {
